Vendored verbatim from cathrynlavery/diagram-design (https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design),
plugin version 2.4.0, upstream commit 09df49d8d1a1c7fb2efdfcdc7a2a0713534350a6 (2026-08-14).
Only the skill payload (skills/diagram-design/) is carried here; the four slash commands
ship separately and land in .claude/commands/. Nothing in the payload was modified.

Bundled third-party icon sets are attributed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md next to this file;
the paths quoted there are relative to the upstream repository root.

